#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:51
msgid "Audiovisual Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:52
msgid "Corpus view of the audiovisual material: sources and countries ranked by recordings or by runtime, how long the recordings run, publication over time, and what the records carry. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:66
msgid "Loading audiovisual overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:72
msgid "Collection Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:73
msgid "Aggregate visualisations across the entire collection. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:79
msgid "Compare Newspapers"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:80
msgid "Side-by-side comparison of two newspaper corpora (articles or Islamic publications), scoped either to a whole country or a single newspaper. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:98
msgid "Loading newspaper comparison"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:104
msgid "Distinctive Vocabulary"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:105
msgid "What sets each part of the press apart, in two views: the vocabulary a country or a decade uses more than the rest of the collection does (log-likelihood keyness with a false-discovery correction, ranked by effect size), and the years in which coverage of a subject suddenly spiked above its own base rate (Kleinberg burst detection). Complements Term Trends, which shows how often a word is used rather than where it stands out. Data is precomputed from the IWAC articles. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:118
msgid "Loading distinctive vocabulary"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:124
msgid "Entity Networks"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:125
msgid "Co-occurrence networks across the collection: an entity graph linking persons, organisations, events, subjects and places that appear in the same items (layout precomputed), and a geographic network of co-mentioned places drawn over the basemap. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:137
msgid "Loading entity networks"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:143
msgid "Index Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:144
msgid "Explore authority entities (persons, places, organisations, events, topics) and Dublin Core Subject + Spatial Coverage prevalence over time. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:159
msgid "Loading index overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:165
msgid "Laïcité"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:166
msgid "A dossier on laïcité (secularism) across the whole IWAC corpus: press coverage, Islamic periodicals, archival documents and scholarship. Eleven views: where the curated subject tag and the word itself diverge, an annotated timeline linking spikes to the documents that prompted them, the archival dossier, a searchable concordance of the actual sentences, collocates, the press-versus-periodicals comparison, the actors and institutions, the arenas being contested, the per-model AI framing, a map of the places named, and the bibliography. Readable snippets are limited to items whose full text is public. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:202
msgid "Loading laïcité dossier"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:209
msgid "Press Language"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:210
msgid "Press language metrics of the newspaper articles: readability (Flesch), lexical richness (MATTR) and article length over time, with newspapers ranked by readability and richness. Data is precomputed from the OCR text of the IWAC articles subset. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:220
msgid "Loading press language metrics"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:226
msgid "On This Day"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:227
msgid "Items published on today's date across the collection's decades: newspaper articles and periodical issues with full publication dates, with page scans and a line of the text where they exist. Readers can read the day in the Gregorian or the Hijri calendar (each picks its own documents), switch between three layouts, and unfold the full list for the day. The block removes itself silently when no data is available, so it is safe on a homepage. Data is precomputed from the IWAC dataset."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:233
msgid "Islamic Organisations Co-occurrence"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:234
msgid "A heatmap of the ideas that cluster around each major West African Islamic organisation (UIB, CNI, COSIM, CSI, FAIB, UMT) in the press: for a chosen organisation, which pairs of words keep turning up together near its name. Data is precomputed from the IWAC articles. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:245
msgid "Loading organisation co-occurrences"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:251
msgid "Periodicals Semantic Landscape"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:252
msgid "Zoomable map of the Islamic-periodical corpus: every issue placed by the semantic similarity of its table of contents (UMAP over AI embeddings), colour-faceted by country or decade. Data is precomputed. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:265 src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:392
msgid "Loading semantic landscape"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:271
msgid "Periodicals Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:272
msgid "Islamic periodicals overview: publication runs, issues per year by country, languages, countries, and top subjects. Data is precomputed from the IWAC publications subset. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:284
msgid "Loading periodicals overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:290
msgid "Press Bylines"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:291
msgid "Who signed the press: byline coverage over time and the most prolific journalists and press agencies, with active spans and frequent subjects, linked to their authority records where they exist. Data is precomputed from the IWAC articles subset. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:302
msgid "Loading press bylines"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:308
msgid "Press Reprints"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:309
msgid "Pairs of near-identical articles printed by different newspapers: syndicated wire copy (PANA, AFP), shared communiqués and reprints, found by comparing how closely articles are worded. Shows which outlets circulated the same copy, with the full pair list. Data is precomputed from the IWAC articles. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:321
msgid "Loading press reprints"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:327
msgid "References Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:328
msgid "Bibliographic references overview: timeline, types, languages, countries, top authors and subjects, country-by-type treemap, and co-authorship network. Data is precomputed from the IWAC references subset. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:341
msgid "Loading references overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:347
msgid "Scary Terms"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:348
msgid "Terms related to radicalism and extremism across the IWAC collection in seven views: an animated bar-chart race, time trends with historical-event markers, by country, global, a co-occurrence matrix, a word cloud of the surrounding vocabulary, and a map of the places mentioned. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:371
msgid "Loading scary terms"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:378
msgid "Semantic Landscape"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:379
msgid "Zoomable map of the whole press corpus: every article placed by the semantic similarity of its full text (UMAP over AI embeddings), colour-faceted by country, decade or topic. Data is precomputed. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:398
msgid "Sentiment Atlas"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:399
msgid "AI sentiment atlas of the newspaper articles: polarity, centrality of Islam and subjectivity over time and by country as rated by several language models, plus cross-model agreement. All figures are AI-generated assessments precomputed from the IWAC articles subset. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:410
msgid "Loading sentiment atlas"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:416
msgid "Spatial Exploration"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:417
msgid "Interactive world map of every place mentioned in the collection, with country focus and an entity picker (persons, organisations, events, subjects, places) that maps the locations related to the selected entity. Data is precomputed. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:428
msgid "Loading spatial exploration"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:434
msgid "Term Trends"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:435
msgid "The IWAC \"Ngram viewer\": chart the per-year share of articles whose full text contains any frequent term. Search the vocabulary, overlay up to eight terms, and switch between shares and absolute counts. Data is precomputed from the articles subset. No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:446
msgid "Loading term trends"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:452
msgid "Topic Explorer"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:453
msgid "LDA-30 topic overview of the IWAC articles subset, with a treemap of all topics and a per-topic drill-down (calendar heatmap, country / newspaper distributions, most-representative articles). No configuration needed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:474
msgid "Loading Topic Explorer"
msgstr ""

